WEBVTT

00:00.049 --> 00:04.970
This is a work of fiction.
Underage drinking is strongly prohibited and illegal.
Scenes involving alcohol with forceful consumption and shameful acts are not encouraged. Please view this as a comedy. Furthermore, all characters appearing in this work are of legal age.

00:05.679 --> 00:09.683
Chisa, I beg you. Stay by my side.

00:10.476 --> 00:11.477
No.

00:11.685 --> 00:14.230
I'm not asking anything else of you.

00:14.396 --> 00:16.941
Just stay by my side.

00:17.107 --> 00:20.444
No way. Give up already.

00:23.072 --> 00:24.990
No...

00:26.951 --> 00:30.746
I only want you to sit next to me
and let me see your answers!

00:34.208 --> 00:38.420
-Sorry, I couldn't get her to help us cheat.
-I see.

00:38.587 --> 00:41.257
What are we going to do? We're going to fail.

00:41.423 --> 00:43.759
I don't want to fail German.

00:43.968 --> 00:46.470
Nothing we can do.
We'll have to help ourselves.

00:46.637 --> 00:49.181
Are you serious?
You're going to start studying now?

00:49.348 --> 00:51.350
There's no time before the test.

00:51.517 --> 00:54.645
I'm going to see how small I can photocopy my notes.

00:54.853 --> 00:56.897
You're going to help yourself cheat.

00:58.315 --> 01:00.526
This is the smallest that I can still read.

01:00.693 --> 01:02.278
It's pretty small.

01:02.444 --> 01:04.780
We have to think of where to hide it.

01:05.364 --> 01:08.575
Kitahara! Cheating, huh?
Let me in on it!

01:08.742 --> 01:09.785
Me too! Me too!

01:09.952 --> 01:13.038
Why do I always attract such losers?

01:13.205 --> 01:14.790
Birds of a feather flock together.

01:14.999 --> 01:16.625
So how will we conceal it?

01:16.792 --> 01:17.835
Well...

01:18.002 --> 01:20.129
For example, in my pencil box.

01:20.296 --> 01:21.297
METHOD 1: A PENCIL BOX

01:21.505 --> 01:22.589
Under my drink label.

01:22.756 --> 01:23.799
METHOD 2: A DRINK LABEL

01:24.008 --> 01:25.092
Inside my towel.

01:25.259 --> 01:26.302
METHOD 3: A TOWEL

01:27.886 --> 01:29.013
How about you, Nojima?

01:29.179 --> 01:30.848
I'm going to do a "wannai"!

01:31.015 --> 01:33.309
One night? You're going to pull an all-nighter?

01:33.517 --> 01:35.185
No. I'll put it in my arm!

01:36.395 --> 01:40.357
-What are you going to do, Kitahara?
-I'm going to put it on the back of my fan.

01:40.524 --> 01:41.817
I'll hide it in my clothes.

01:42.026 --> 01:45.112
You guys know it's important to pass German, right?

01:45.279 --> 01:46.864
-Yeah!
-Of course!

01:47.031 --> 01:48.449
We're not giving up!

01:48.615 --> 01:50.826
We're all going to pass together!

01:51.035 --> 01:52.828
Yeah!

01:55.372 --> 01:57.333
Okay. Well then...

01:57.499 --> 01:59.585
First, put away your pencil boxes.

02:02.004 --> 02:04.340
Idiot. You should've seen that coming.

02:04.506 --> 02:05.841
Hey! Help me!

02:06.008 --> 02:07.051
I don't know...

02:07.217 --> 02:10.387
And no eating or drinking.

02:11.305 --> 02:12.931
Don't look at me like that!

02:13.098 --> 02:14.808
Do something!

02:15.684 --> 02:20.230
How come everyone else looks so calm?

02:20.397 --> 02:23.108
Do they have confidence in themselves?

02:23.275 --> 02:24.943
The test starts at 1:00.

02:25.110 --> 02:27.571
You can leave if you finish early.

02:28.405 --> 02:29.615
Begin.

02:29.782 --> 02:31.575
I'm leaving.

02:32.034 --> 02:34.411
I see. They already made their decision.

02:35.954 --> 02:38.874
The letters smudged from my sweat! I can't read it!

02:39.041 --> 02:40.709
Idiot.

02:40.876 --> 02:43.379
It's because you used your arm when it's so hot.

02:43.545 --> 02:45.339
Shimokawa isn't here.

02:45.506 --> 02:47.591
Yeah. Just now, he...

02:51.470 --> 02:54.306
I'LL START STUDYING NOW.
TELL ME WHAT'S ON TOMORROW'S TEST.

02:54.473 --> 02:55.682
NO NEED TO KNOW ANYMORE.

02:56.308 --> 02:57.643
Just now?

02:57.810 --> 03:01.355
Don't worry about it.
One more person died. That's all.

03:01.855 --> 03:03.399
But...

03:03.565 --> 03:05.484
My cheat sheet isn't helping at all.

03:05.651 --> 03:08.821
We have to help each other.

03:08.987 --> 03:10.114
It's teamwork time.

03:10.280 --> 03:11.824
Leave it to me.

03:11.990 --> 03:13.992
